<title>USA: Commerce's Price sees continued US trend growth.</title>
<headline>Commerce's Price sees continued US trend growth.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acting Commerce Undersecretary Lee Price said on Thursday he expected the U.S. economy to continue growing at least at its trend rate in the next few quarters.</p>
<p>&quot;My sense is that the economy should sustain at least trend rate growth for the next few quarters,&quot; Price told a news briefing. &quot;It's a pretty benign picture,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
